            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
