            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
              Both employ a vertical tricolor of blue, yellow, and red. <strong>Chad uses a darker, saturated indigo blue</strong> (Pantone 281C), while <strong>Romania uses a slightly brighter cobalt blue</strong> (Pantone 280C). In digital quizzes, look for the darker navy hue on Chad.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
              <span>🇮🇪 Ireland vs. 🇨🇮 Côte d’Ivoire (Ivory Coast)</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500">Hoist Orientation</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
              <strong>Ireland is Green-White-Orange</strong> (green represents Irish nationalism at the flagpole hoist). <strong>Côte d’Ivoire is Orange-White-Green</strong> (orange represents savannah grasslands at the flagpole hoist).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
              <span>🇦🇺 Australia vs. 🇳🇿 New Zealand</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500">Southern Cross Stars</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
              <strong>Australia has 6 white stars</strong> (five 7-pointed stars and one 5-pointed star, including the large Commonwealth Star under the canton). <strong>New Zealand has only 4 red stars with white borders</strong>, all 5-pointed.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
              <span>🇳🇱 Netherlands vs. 🇱🇺 Luxembourg</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500">Sky Blue vs. Ultramarine</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
              Both have horizontal red-white-blue stripes. <strong>Luxembourg features a distinctly light sky-blue stripe</strong> and a 1:2 or 3:5 proportion, while the <strong>Netherlands uses a deep ultramarine cobalt blue</strong> with a 2:3 ratio.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
